[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1856515983","pull_request_review_id":2458273263,"id":1856515983,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5uqC-P","diff_hunk":"@@ -174,6 +176,7 @@ void FileDialog::_native_dialog_cb_with_options(bool p_ok, const Vector<String>\n \tfile->set_text(f);\n \tdir->set_text(f.get_base_dir());\n \tfilter->select(p_filter);\n+\tupdate_dir();","path":"scene/gui/file_dialog.cpp","commit_id":"e0b4f3d314a00b2a634ced1b5dd988b2d2f7ed36","original_commit_id":"84fc147833d45735cb22b7feb34d39cfd4e3927e","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\r\n\t_change_dir(f.get_base_dir());\r\n```\r\n\r\n`current_dir` would just be reset to the same value when using `update_dir()`. Calling `_change_dir()` properly updates the `current_dir` and also calls `update_dir()`.\r\n\r\nBut this made me discover some more bugs:\r\n\r\n1. When listening to the `*_selected` signals in GDScript, reading `current_*` variables in the signal handlers gives outdated values, since the values are updated too late. User must wait 1 frame to get updated values. Fix: move the code that updates file and dir above the signal emission.\r\n2. Reading the value of `current_dir` (after fixing bug 1) does not include the drive letter. Fix: getter should return `full_dir` instead I assume?\r\n3. Reading the value of `current_path` (after fixing bug 1) returns this: `/Users/Public/Test/C:/Users/Public/Test/test123.json`. Didn't read the code to figure out why.\r\n\r\nLet me know which of these you'd fix in this PR, and I can make issues for the rest!","created_at":"2024-11-25T12:15:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T12:26:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99652#discussion_r1856515983","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99652","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1856515983"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99652#discussion_r1856515983"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99652"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1856515983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":179,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":25,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1856523825","pull_request_review_id":2458285665,"id":1856523825,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5uqE4x","diff_hunk":"@@ -174,6 +176,7 @@ void FileDialog::_native_dialog_cb_with_options(bool p_ok, const Vector<String>\n \tfile->set_text(f);\n \tdir->set_text(f.get_base_dir());\n \tfilter->select(p_filter);\n+\tupdate_dir();","path":"scene/gui/file_dialog.cpp","commit_id":"e0b4f3d314a00b2a634ced1b5dd988b2d2f7ed36","original_commit_id":"84fc147833d45735cb22b7feb34d39cfd4e3927e","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2N